  caseId: 0
  title: Last Coffee at Kite
  briefing: Last night, Encik Rizal Hamid, founder of Kite Design Studio, was found
    dead beside the front desk. The gold Design of the Year award is gone from its
    smashed display case. It looks like a break-in, but the doctor says he was poisoned.
    Four people had a reason to be at the studio last night. Search the room, tag
    the evidence, and name the person who killed him.
  suspects:
  - id: X_grace
    displayName: Grace Wong
    role: Studio manager
    alibi: '"I locked up at 7:00 pm and was home by 7:30."'
  - id: X_kumar
    displayName: Kumar Raj
    role: Night cleaner
    alibi: '"I finished cleaning and left the building at 9:05 pm."'
  - id: X_lena
    displayName: Lena Ortiz
    role: Rival designer next door
    alibi: '"I was at dinner nearby from 7 until 10 pm."'
  - id: X_aiman
    displayName: Aiman Hakim
    role: Junior designer
    alibi: '"I was at the gym from 9:15 pm until late."'
  correctSuspectId: X_grace
  keyEvidenceIds:
  - X_K1
  - X_K2
  - X_K3
  - X_K4
  experimenterNotes: 'Generated from docs/cases.md by FYP > Build Case Scenes.

